{"id":"wb-1-122","name":"颐和园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"颐和园","text":"颐和园是清朝的皇家行宫和大型皇家园林，位于中国北京市海淀区西北，占地297公顷，主要由万寿山万寿山 (北京)和昆明湖组成。颐和园修建于清朝乾隆年间（原名清漪园），重建于光绪年间，曾属于清朝北京西郊三山五园之一。颐和园素以人工建筑与自然山水巧妙结合的造园手法著称于世，是中国园林艺术顶峰时期的代表。1998年12月2日，颐和园被评为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A2%90%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":93003740,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93003740","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/27d8bf1d6d8abf9d68df0ade.jpg","title":"颐和园万寿山佛香阁.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%A2%90%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%AD%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BD%9B%E9%A6%99%E9%98%81.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/%E9%A2%90%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%AD%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BD%9B%E9%A6%99%E9%98%81.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"shizhao","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"​颐和园万寿山佛香阁","width":320,"height":215}}